  "title": {
    "zh": "在路障前停住",
    "en": "Stop before the wall"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "用扫描结果控制 while",
    "en": "Use the scan to control a while loop"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "一直沿着通道向右走。每走一步都要重新检查右侧，在路障前的出口格停下。不同棋盘的路障位置不同。",
    "en": "Follow the corridor to the right. Scan again after each step and stop at the exit just before the wall. Different boards have different wall positions."
  },
  "hints": [
    {
      "zh": "把扫描放进 while 的条件里，程序每次检查时都能看到芽芽当前位置右边是什么。",
      "en": "Place scan inside the while condition so each check sees what is to the right of Sprout now."
    }
  ],
  "tiles": [
